            "detailed_description": "Working alongside your colleague 'Rebecca' has always been a bit of a trial, as she just can't quit trying to push the boundaries of modern science. You have even begun to wonder if she is a scientist at all, or instead more of a mythical alchemist! Now your friendship and your life will be put to the test when you try her latest drug. One that incidentally turns you into a woman... Complete with all the aspects that entails.<br><br>Now you will have to truly walk a mile in another persons shoes, as well as their bras and panties too...<br><br>In this game you have your best friend Greg to help you and Rebecca searching for a cure. Though who knows which of these two will help you get through this or simply wish to... Ahem! study you closer.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A Visual Novel Game with Multiple Choices<br></li><li>Multiple different endings based on your decisions<br></li><li>Adult content and sex scenes to explore<br></li><li>Fun comedic moments to enjoy<br></li><li>Your decisions determine the events and story</li></ul><br>* All characters included in the game are over the age of 18.",
